Author: 仓鼠王 <yjianbin419@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Sep 23 02:04:09 2026 +0800

    fix(frontend): freeze the tight budget caveat as one sentence the gate compares literally (ORD-0226)
    
    The red team's E1 arm appended a reassurance built from words outside ALLAY_WORDS, which a
    word-table assertion cannot see, so the screen could warn and reassure in the same breath
    while the gate stayed green. The caveat is now a frozen constant and the assertion is string
    equality; three arms (E1 verbatim, a self-denying rewrite, one punctuation mark) each redden
    the node, measured through live_checks/mutation_anchor_guard.py.

